{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through <strong>hauntingly beautiful</strong> environments with two unlikely companions: Amy, a mysterious armored girl, and Roka, a lovable yet <i>eerie</i> monster. In this narrative-driven experience, your bond with each companion subtly <strong>shapes the final narration</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no combat. No death. Just unsettling discoveries, <i>occasional jump scares</i>, and a creeping sense of dread in the darkness. Your companions are your only light. <strong>Stay close</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 chapters of immersive psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling encounters with a ghoul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions that illuminate your path with <i>dynamic</i> lights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting music &amp; atmospheric sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven ending based on your emotional proximity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable <strong>chapter select</strong> after completion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FORMIDO: The darkness remembers who you walked with.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: The core aspect of this game is the atmosphere. It is recommended for those who mostly seek to experience the mood.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Yesterday Begins Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913230/f7c7933ddff9b60674ef5ba328252571fab9b5ed.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913230/c9a85e752295706357e9e29a8a8a65050b516267.jpg"},{"name":"East Begins Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913230/f7c7933ddff9b60674ef5ba32825